                                                "sense_id": "474fbc99-e33a-3c51-aeae-4cb4c90877a6",
                                                "text": "The subway map was quite informational, allowing us to determine the most efficient route to our destination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d497681c-8b94-4026-8572-abe2b5409e66",
                                                "sense_id": "474fbc99-e33a-3c51-aeae-4cb4c90877a6",
                                                "text": "This exercise gave students an insight into [...] how lexicographers work with unfamiliar lexis, and the informational sources that lexicographers use to construct dictionaries."
                                            },
