                                                "example_id": "e657a6c0-bec0-4460-9785-596a7ad7852b",
                                                "sense_id": "474fbc99-e33a-3c51-aeae-4cb4c90877a6",
                                                "text": "Ukrainian Khortytsia Group of Forces Spokesperson Major Viktor Trehubov stated on June 15 that Russian forces are likely moving toward Dnipropetrovsk Oblast in an effort to achieve “political goals”- likely meaning informational objectives meant to shape international opinion about Russia’s war in Ukraine."
